WEBVTT

00:01:56.608 --> 00:02:00.482
in order to guarantee the largest possible
fine for the scoundrel

00:02:00.482 --> 00:02:03.130
and the greatest compensation 
for his victims?

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:07.560
Pause the video now if you want
to figure it out for yourself.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.497
Answer in 3

00:02:08.497 --> 00:02:09.641
Answer in 2

00:02:09.641 --> 00:02:11.431
Answer in 1

00:02:11.436 --> 00:02:14.486
You don’t want to overshoot
by being too greedy.

00:02:14.486 --> 00:02:16.636
But there is a way you can guarantee

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:20.006
to get more than half of the scoundrel’s 
stash.

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:24.026
The situation resembles an 
adversarial game like chess –

00:02:24.026 --> 00:02:27.676
only here you can’t see the 
opponent’s position.

00:02:27.676 --> 00:02:31.356
To figure out the minimum number of rubies
you’re guaranteed to win,